config BR2_PACKAGE_BANANADS
	bool "bananads"
	depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_USES_GLIBC
	depends on BR2_INSTALL_LIBSTDCPP
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ALSA_LIB
	select BR2_PACKAGE_ZLIB
	help
	  BananaDS, the Nintendo DS emulator on melonDS's core, with SuperDrastic's display path, governor and sound
	  (github.com/JorreFog/SuperDrastic, bananads/). Its launcher is /usr/libexec/banana/run-bananads
	  (docs/EMULATORS.md says what it is given and what is expected of it); Settings > Nintendo DS > Emulator
	  switches the DS shelf to it.
